msgid "Conversation identity"
msgstr "Identidad de la conversación"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:599
msgid ""
"Sharing identity makes DocsBot conversations non-anonymous. Each field is "
"optional and is sent only after the visitor passes your access rules."
